      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.33 (up from ₹2.23 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹16.1b (up 16% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹551.1m (up 4.7% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 3.4% (down from 3.8% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 15% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 30% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
